OL,3,ANvidia shares up 30% and tech stocks
OL,4,Arally after Jensen Huang returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia shares have opened up 30% after
OL,7,Fthe tech firm reinstated Jensen Huang
OL,8,Fas its chief executive with immediate
OL,9,Feffect.
OL,11,FHis shock reinstatement comes less than
OL,12,Ftwo weeks after Huang resigned after
OL,13,Fadmitting an affair with a woman who
OL,14,Fwas alleged to be a Chinese spy, a
OL,15,Fperiod in which shares in the chipmaker
OL,16,Fhave also fallen significantly.
OL,18,FThe jump in Nvidia shares - which
OL,19,Flifted its market value by about $1
OL,20,Ftrillion - has also lifted stock
OL,21,Fmarkets, with the tech-heavy Nasdaq up
OL,22,F6.5% in early trading.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
